zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他正式宣布自己为候选人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">こうして</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这样；如此；以此方式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225005\">こうして<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつも<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我通常就是这么煮鱼的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">後者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后者；后一个；继承人；后代</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75362\">このうち<ruby>大事<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なのは<ruby>後者<rp>(</rp><rt>こうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">其中重要的是后者。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">校舎</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">校舍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173573\"><ruby>校舎<rp>(</rp><rt>こうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>内<rp>(</rp><rt>ない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってはいけません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不能在学校建筑里跑步</span></div></li>","<l